Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Ports", "GuideTitle",
 CellID->942062912,ExpressionUUID->"a3a3c038-ca24-47b7-9945-83f1c1312fe3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["Port"]], "paclet:WolframDiagrammaticComputation/ref/Port", 
    "WolframDiagrammaticComputation Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "44cc724b-a50c-4488-b253-4d37d85f78dc"],
 " is the typed endpoint of a diagram. Every ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["Diagram"]], 
    "paclet:WolframDiagrammaticComputation/ref/Diagram", 
    "WolframDiagrammaticComputation Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "ccb11bc5-184d-48ec-b22d-33854dd53f30"],
 " carries a list of input ports and a list of output ports; composing \
diagrams works by matching ports of compatible ",
 StyleBox["types", "TI"],
 ". Ports have a small algebra of their own \[LongDash] they can be made dual \
(reversed in direction), tensored together with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["PortProduct"]], 
    "paclet:WolframDiagrammaticComputation/ref/PortProduct", 
    "WolframDiagrammaticComputation Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "ce5d0aee-fa65-4292-b37f-2ef137606fe3"],
 ", summed with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["PortSum"]], 
    "paclet:WolframDiagrammaticComputation/ref/PortSum", 
    "WolframDiagrammaticComputation Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "f570211c-9bb1-46be-bb3e-fe3bf3b33e88"],
 ", raised to a power, tagged with context-specific annotations, and tested \
with predicates. This guide collects the operations that build and transform \
ports independently of the diagrams they appear in."
}], "GuideAbstract",
 CellID->2001916300,ExpressionUUID->"ef0ab37b-2e0d-4399-8f7e-82603ccbe925"]
}, Open  ]],

